        "notes": "Buy  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) or  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) if you did not buy it on the previous round.\n\nIf you can't afford both, you can sell  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) and replace it with  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2), or leave the slot empty if you are that far behind.\n\n [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) is a good choice, but you should sell  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) because the bonus  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed)  would be overkill. Ana's 3-instance hits trigger all of the bonus damage from  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) at once, making for a good instakill combo.\n\nIf you can afford it and bought  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429), replace  [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) with  [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) or  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6). \n\n [Dash Boots](item_1ec670c7-a465-4ca0-9d16-aeeedab7894e)  always remain a solid option, depending on your preferred playstyle.",
