        "notes": "For your final power, get  [Our Turn](item_6e0fdb41-c00f-41d9-8ec2-1246b34a539a). With  [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) and the bonus  [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) from  [No Scope Needed](item_823db5eb-5a24-4bac-b850-0aa34e76b4f6) you should be able to charge your nano really quickly.\n\nIf you want a more selfish power you can instead get [My Turn](item_5cea2ccb-c889-4447-8a84-c704c1da1521).\n\nFor an offensive option,  [Time Out](item_34fc2f6c-ecd9-489e-98ca-d08f3eb2fac1) is an excellent choice.\n\nThis round you should replace [Wrist Wraps](item_19183386-c859-42ca-93f2-355d47d01e36) with  [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) if you didn't have already.\n\nAlternatively, if you prefer a more  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) heavy approach, you can buy  [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) to spam nades more frequently.",
